WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.450
After I competed with Shaoan
who's my mother's first student

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:36.680
in Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.460
the destined tofu competition

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.520
is finally going to end today.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.440
The winner is

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:48.850
Super Chef Liu Maoxing!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.040
Great!

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.180
Mao!

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.270
Mao!

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:54.220
We won.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.000
In the long-lasting Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.260
with the Dark Cooking Society,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.220
we won two rounds, lost one round and tied in a round.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.130
Finally we won.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.740
Our victory has also prevented

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:02.710
the crisis of the Shanghai Cooking Society.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.980
Well, please give us

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.850
the map and the code, as agreed.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.680
The Yangtze River Burns! Shaoan Dies in the Ocean

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:40.230
What happened?

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.860
Shaoan, what did you do?

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.770
I've already activated the emergency self-destruct device.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.020
Soon this ship will sink.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.390
What?

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.010
How could that be?

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.230
Where is the exit?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.950
It's sinking! The ship is sinking!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:13.910
You bastard!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.040
I've already thrown away

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.460
all the lifeboats.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.120
No one can get out of here alive.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.010
Everyone will die at the bottom of the sea.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.800
You!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.560
Let's stop here.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:58.520
Lei En!

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:00.400
Hey, Lei En!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.000
Go upstairs now, everyone!

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.170
Soon this ship will be submerged by the sea!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.000
Lei En. Lei En!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.660
Meili, you don't have to worry about Lei En.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:14.740
He'll be fine.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:15.710
But...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:16.710
Meili,

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.420
we have to trust Lei En now.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.200
Right. We have to find a way out of here

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:21.870
as soon as possible.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.350
Hurry up! We're running out of time!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.130
Meili,

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:27.610
hurry up!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.060
Look! There seems to be an exit.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.190
I'll take a look.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:33.990
Thank you.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.440
There is a door.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.330
I think we can get out.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.510
What's going on? Crap!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.880
What are you doing, Silang?

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.450
How could you say that?

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.140
Aren't you worried about my safety?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.020
Let's stop talking about it.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.220
Can we get out of here?

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.550
I did saw a door and stairs just now.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.670
But after the explosion,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.250
I'm not sure about their condition.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:10.970
Anyway, let's take a look first.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.390
There's no other way.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.830
No. It's a dead end.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.670
Crap!

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.190
Stop pushing each other. Go back.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.440
There's no way here. Go back.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.410
Hang in there, father.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:34.890
Sorry.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.730
Silang, how is it?

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:37.880
Can we go across it?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.730
There seems to be a small fire.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.510
But I think we still can go across it now.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.780
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.550
Meili, are you okay?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.930
I'm fine. It just scared me.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.050
Come here. Hurry up.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.310
Mao, hurry up!

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.750
Chef Xie,

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.890
I think the outside is behind this wall.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.890
I'm sure about that.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.540
What? Really?

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:32.190
Are you sure, Silang?

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.510
Here comes Chef Xie’s unique skill.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.140
He succeeded! We'll survive!

00:06:58.570 --> 00:06:59.690
It's so high.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:02.320
We've climbed to a very high place.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.680
We tried to walk out,

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:05.940
but it's so high here.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:06.960
I'm so angry!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.640
Old judge!

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.830
You're also safe?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.880
Looks like we can't jump from here.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:19.170
Xiang En, you...

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.320
The judges who cannot understand

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.240
the strength of the Dark Cooking Society

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.430
and a group of idiots who are overconfident.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:29.160
All of you should die in the East China Sea.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.200
That woman.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.550
Although she's gorgeous,

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.670
she's very evil.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.200
The code and the map.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.310
What should we do?

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.250
It's not easy for us to win the competition.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.820
What should we do now?

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:57.920
You can't run away.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.210
Lei En!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:00.660
Lei En is so great.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:01.580
Lei En!

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:03.380
Good.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:04.640
He looks so cool.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.390
I'm so jealous of him.

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:20.870
What's up, Lei En?

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.810
Why don't you use the big knife on your back

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.000
which you're proud of?

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.120
I'm not falling for that.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.090
To deal with you, my hands are enough.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:29.860
You bastard!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:36.790
Let me go!

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:38.610
Give us the code and the map

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:39.710
and get out of my sight now!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.480
Lei En, you...

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.360
Well, you can go now.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.060
Xiang En, I remember that you're good at swimming.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.360
Lei En, remember,

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.140
it's not over.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.260
No matter where you go,

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:17.870
our Dark Cooking Society

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.010
will never forgive you!

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.100
See you, Lei En.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.590
We'll meet again!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.700
Great!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.670
He has taken both the code and the map back.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:37.970
Good job, Lei En!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.410
Be quick. The ship is sinking.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:45.250
This ship will sink into the sea sooner or later.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:47.020
But there are so many people.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.620
Such a small boat

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:49.470
is useless at all.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:50.710
What should I do?

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.500
There's a ship!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:08.550
Yes, it's really a ship!

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.220
Great!

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.140
That ship is...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.100
It's Chayi.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.240
It's Captain Chayi.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:22.170
We'll be saved.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.120
Hurry up! Full steam ahead!

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:24.970
Wow.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.780
I don't know what happened,

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.520
but that ship is sinking into the sea soon.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:29.370
Hurry up!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.100
Go full steam ahead now!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.810
Hurry up or that ship will sink into the sea.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:47.260
Go fast!

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.440
Go faster!

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:49.830
Hurry up!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.250
Be quick, Captain Chayi!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.820
It's too slow. I'm so mad!

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.020
He... Is he...

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:55.910
Is he Lord Hu of the Shipping Alliance?

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:58.720
Why is the leader of the alliance, Lord Zhang, also there?

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.030
Get close to that ship. Hurry up!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:01.860
Yes.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:19.040
Great! We'll be saved!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:24.790
I'll pass the board to you.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:25.870
Take it, guys.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.270
Climb up from here.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.430
Take your time, everyone.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.540
No rush. Take your time.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.090
Be careful.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.470
Come on. Come here.

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.010
I'll go first.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.030
Go after me, guys.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:44.870
OK.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:46.140
Let's go.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.350
We're saved.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.030
Well, I'll go next!

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:59.000
Meili, go.

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.360
You're gonna be fine. Come on.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.370
Sister!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.520
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:10.430
Chef Xie,

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.070
my father can't go there.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.600
Don't worry. I'll carry him over.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.690
You can go first.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.640
But...

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:17.440
Don't worry.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.450
Just leave it to me.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.400
OK.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.500
Sir, please cling to me.

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:27.370
OK.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:28.690
Well, let's go.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:34.490
Father!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:35.120
Mao!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.390
Chef Xie!

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.320
Mao, you idiot!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.250
Come here now!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.330
Mao!

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.420
Mao, hurry up!

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.880
Come here now!

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:51.900
Come on.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.080
OK. I'll be right there!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:55.530
Mao.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.710
Shaoan, why are you still here?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.470
The ship is sinking into the sea.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.290
This is the final battle.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.040
Mao, come here now.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:07.740
Mao!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.010
What are you doing, Mao?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.360
Just ignore him. Come here now!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.180
Mao.

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.560
Mao!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.440
Hurry up, you idiot!

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.500
It's obvious that

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.630
no matter what I do, God always wants me to die.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.680
As a chef of the Dark Cooking Society,

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.060
I can't even accomplish my last mission.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.750
Shaoan, it's not too late to mend your ways.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.050
Let's go back to the bright world together.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.680
Let's work hard together and use our skills

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.720
to make more people happy.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.190
Mao.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.660
I will never

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.070
let you get on that ship.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.230
Go with me, Shaoan.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:48.980
Shut up!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.980
Let's go to hell together!

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:56.790
Shaoan, stop.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.640
Mao!

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:06.560
Mao, don't talk to him again!

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.150
Go to hell!

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.700
Mao, you can't escape this time.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:20.170
The tag we've been playing since we were young

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.480
is finally going to end today.

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:24.700
Shaoan.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.110
Without you,

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:32.940
my life

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.590
would never become like that.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:35.940
Stop, Shaoan!

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.800
Mao, where is he?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.060
Mao!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:14:59.520
He's there!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:01.940
Mao.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:07.370
Cling to me with both of your hands, Shaoan.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.130
You... What on earth do you want?

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.080
Let me go.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.580
Stop doing stupid things!

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:14.970
Mao!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:15.750
Mao.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.420
Idiot!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.020
Why do you have to save that heartless bastard?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.380
Let me go.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.670
Why don't you let me go?

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:23.830
I can't.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.490
I don't know why I'm doing this, either.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:29.210
I just...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.210
Crap!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.190
That guy wants to attack Mao.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.560
Mao!

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.900
I... I just...

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:41.840
I just can't

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:42.960
sit by and watch

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.210
you die like that. You made my mother's dish

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.410
which I had never seen before.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.340
You're talking nonsense.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.780
Your mother died because of me.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:52.930
Have you forgiven me

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.150
for what I did?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:55.550
My mother...

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.720
My mother never hated you.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:15:58.950
What?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.290
Before she died, she told me.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.060
She said she believed Shaoan will come back.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.400
My mother dreamed that

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:06.950
my sister, you and me

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:09.240
can work together

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:12.350
to turn Chrysanthemum Tower
into the best restaurant in China.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.940
The goal of cooking is to make more people happy.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.650
In order to fulfill my mother's dream,

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:20.950
I will never let you die.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:21.720
Shaoan!

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:25.020
Are you willing to forgive someone like me?

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.680
I did hate you so much at that time.

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:30.990
But my mother's dream is also my dream.

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:32.930
Let's work hard together, Shaoan!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.120
Chef Pai.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:59.290
Take it, Mao.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:05.630
I believe you'll need it one day.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.300
I don't want to return to the mountains of Sichuan.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.720
Just let me die in my favorite sea

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.800
which is filled with my dreams.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:15.640
Shaoan.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:18.980
Shaoan!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.230
Hope you can remember me.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.540
Remember

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:27.290
the apprentice who has hated you for ten years!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:30.210
Shaoan!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.760
Mao!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.210
Mao!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.140
Mao!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.450
Jump over here now!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.690
Lei En!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:46.830
Hurry up,

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.180
or you'll be dragged into the whirlpool!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:48.820
Mao.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.120
Great!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:04.760
Leave here now!

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:18.880
Shaoan.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.720
Shaoan is really a pathetic man.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.350
At the very beginning, he was

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.290
kicked out of the cooking society

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:31.880
because he failed to make Chef Pai's dish.

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:33.230
I didn't expect that in the end,

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.590
he lost everything

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.350
because he made a dish of Chef Pai.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.190
Shaoan.

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:50.630
Shaoan!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.630
It's so weird.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.800
How on earth should we read it?

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:01.470
Looks like turning it upside down is also wrong.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.430
Then even if we have the map and the code,

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.790
we still don't know

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.940
where to find the legendary cookware.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:12.300
What's up?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:13.930
Let me take a look, Silang.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.260
It's here.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.770
Well,

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:36.140
there is only a statue of Kṣitigarbha.

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:36.880
No. Wait a minute.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:38.520
Take a closer look at it.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.830
Isn’t it the Kitchen God who's the tutelary of the stove?

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.540
(Kitchen God)
The tutelary of the stove?

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:43.430
Since it's the Kitchen God,

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:45.800
the legendary cookware should be here.

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.340
He has been protecting

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.310
the legendary cookware here

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.370
since a thousand years ago.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.730
But compared with the Forever-Spirit Knife in Guangzhou,

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.530
no one is guarding here.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.460
That means the cookware has been left here

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.330
since a thousand years ago.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.690
Sanjie, is there any hint on

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.010
what we should do on the map?

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.410
Let me have a look.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:07.330
Turn the Rock Kitchen God.

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:09.820
That means to turn this statue, right?

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:20.820
The rock!

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:24.890
We finally found it.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.870
The legendary cookware is going to appear soon.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.190
It appears.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.400
Is it the legendary cookware?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.360
If it is,

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.960
I have to say that it's too dirty.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:43.900
Has it already turned into a fossil

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.770
after a thousand years passed?

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.360
Well,

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:49.570
the thousand miles we walked is a waste of effort.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.130
It hurts.

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.100
Don't touch it.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.310
The legendary cookware will choose

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.550
a suitable owner for itself.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.140
Mao.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:28.460
The pot

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:29.720
is breaking.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.550
No.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.130
(Coiled Dragon Pot)
This is the thousand-year-old Coiled Dragon Pot.

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:45.070
Great!

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.460
We found the second cookware!

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.950
Great!

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:50.330
Hurrah!

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.873 --> 00:23:20.158
Oh my God, Xie Lu has been arrested.

00:23:20.373 --> 00:23:24.604
He was turned into a robber by a trap of
an acrobatic troupe he met during his journey.

00:23:24.990 --> 00:23:26.189
The execution is imminent,

00:23:26.189 --> 00:23:27.586
what should I do?

00:23:27.974 --> 00:23:29.429
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.572 --> 00:23:31.827
Save Xie Lu! A Torrent of Noodles!

00:23:32.086 --> 00:23:33.495
It will definitely be interesting!
